WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.800
Go to the ship, we will stand firm like a wall!

2
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:14.800
Quick, don't you tarry! Faster! Come on, come on!

3
00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:20.280
This battle will be my last – let it not be futile!

5
00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:33.920
Mistress, someone has managed to escape the tower!

6
00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:37.820
No matter! The important thing is that this pathetic elf, Clement, has fallen!

7
00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:40.820
And his allod will turn to dust with him!

8
00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:46.000
It's now the time for us, the true descendants of Great Kania...

9
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.000
To get back our past greatness and power!

10
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.120
The alliances that the White Knight has forged have proven themselves!

11
00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:55.620
The hour has come to steer for Quatoch!

12
00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:57.660
So be it.

13
00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:02.160
Besides... The Astral Storm is coming!
